  <tei:text>
    <tei:body>
      <tei:div corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:birkat_hamazon/yiru_et_adonai">
        <tei:p><tei:milestone unit="verse" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/34/10"/><tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:birkat_hamazon/yiru_et_adonai/19"/>Fear Adonoy, [you] His holy ones, for those who fear Him suffer no deprivation. Young lions may feel want and hunger, but those who seek Adonoy, will not be deprived of any good thing.<tei:anchor xml:id="note_1"/> Give thanks to Adonoy, for He is good, for His kindness endures forever.<tei:anchor xml:id="note_2"/> You open Your hand and satisfy the desire of every living being.<tei:anchor xml:id="note_3"/> Blessed is the man who trusts in Adonoy, so that Adonoy is his security.<tei:anchor xml:id="note_4"/> I was young and I have grown old, yet I have never seen a righteous man forsaken, nor his children begging for bread.<tei:anchor xml:id="note_5"/> Adonoy will give strength to His people, Adonoy will bless His people with peace.<tei:anchor xml:id="note_6"/>
<tei:milestone unit="phrase"/>
<tei:milestone unit="verse"/></tei:p>
